# L1DDER — Entry Point & ID Standard

This repository uses the **L1DDER** methodology (Spec-Driven & Roadmap-Gated AI Development).
Rules are written as explicit step-by-step instructions. **Do not skip steps, do not invent custom ID formats, and never modify files before receiving an explicit `"ok"` from the user.**

---

## 1. End-to-End ID Standard (`ID = Folder Name / Anchor`)

Every entity has a strict ID format. **Every child document must store all parent IDs up to `IDEA-NNN` in its "Entity ID Passport" table at the top of the file:**

| Entity | Exact ID Format | Where It Lives (Path / Anchor) | Required Parent IDs Inside |
|--------|-----------------|--------------------------------|----------------------------|
| **Idea** | `IDEA-001` | `docs/ideas.md` (anchor `#idea-001`) | Lists linked `FEAT-NNN` |
| **Feature & Spec** | `FEAT-001` | `docs/backlog.md` (`#feat-001`) + `docs/specs/FEAT-001-<slug>/` | `IDEA-001` |
| **Spec Step (pre-sprint)** | `FEAT-001.01`, ..., `FEAT-001.99` | `docs/specs/FEAT-001-<slug>/tasks.md` & `docs/backlog.md` | `FEAT-001`, `IDEA-001` |
| **Sprint** | `SPRINT-01` | `docs/roadmap.md` + `docs/sprints/SPRINT-01-<slug>/README.md` | `FEAT-001`, `IDEA-001` |
| **Sprint Task** | `TASK-01.01` | `docs/sprints/SPRINT-01-<slug>/tasks/TASK-01.01-<slug>/{plan,summary}.md` | `FEAT-001.01`, `SPRINT-01`, `FEAT-001`, `IDEA-001` |
| **Sprint Hygiene (Doctor)** | `TASK-01.99` | `docs/sprints/SPRINT-01-<slug>/tasks/TASK-01.99-doctor/{plan,summary}.md` | `FEAT-001.99`, `SPRINT-01`, `FEAT-001`, `IDEA-001` |
| **Hotfix** | `HOTFIX-001` | `docs/backlog.md` (Section 3, `#hotfix-001`) | Optional: `FEAT-NNN` / `TASK-NN.MM` |
| **Arch Decision (ADR)** | `ADR-0001` | `docs/adrs/ADR-0001-<slug>.md` | `IDEA-NNN`, `FEAT-NNN` |

---

## 2. Control Slash Commands (`/l1-*`)

When the user invokes any command below, **immediately read the corresponding `SKILL.md` in `l1dder/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` and execute it step by step**:

| Command | Skill File | What the Flow Does |
|---------|------------|--------------------|
| **`/l1-onboard`** | `l1dder/skills/l1-onboard/SKILL.md` | Configures `30-tech-stack.mdc`, `40-skills-router.mdc`, `Makefile` and initializes `docs/concept/`, `docs/ideas.md`, `docs/backlog.md`, `docs/roadmap.md` |
| **`/l1-idea`** | `l1dder/skills/l1-idea/SKILL.md` | Refines an idea → assigns `IDEA-NNN` → records in `docs/ideas.md` |
| **`/l1-feature`** | `l1dder/skills/l1-feature/SKILL.md` | Takes `IDEA-NNN` → creates `docs/specs/FEAT-NNN-<slug>/` → slices `FEAT-NNN.01 .. FEAT-NNN.99` → updates `docs/backlog.md` |
| **`/l1-planning`** | `l1dder/skills/l1-planning/SKILL.md` | Schedules `docs/roadmap.md` → assigns `SPRINT-NN` & `TASK-NN.01 .. TASK-NN.99` → creates `docs/sprints/SPRINT-NN-<slug>/README.md` |
| **`/l1-task`** | `l1dder/skills/l1-task/SKILL.md` | Executes the active task `TASK-NN.MM` from `docs/roadmap.md` (and mandatory `TASK-NN.99` Doctor Checklist at sprint end) |
| **`/l1-hotfix`** | `l1dder/skills/l1-hotfix/SKILL.md` | Fixes an urgent bug bypassing `docs/roadmap.md` (`RED → GREEN`) → logs `HOTFIX-NNN` in `docs/backlog.md` |
| **`/l1-evo`** | `l1dder/skills/l1-evo/SKILL.md` | Evolves `L1DDER` itself following `l1dder/evolution/METHODOLOGY-RULES.md`, logs `WORKLOG-CHANGELOG.md`, updates `HANDOFF.md` |

