## 3. Rules Architecture (`l1dder/rules/` — Core vs Stack)

| File | Layer | Purpose |
|------|-------|---------|
| `00-methodology.mdc` | Core | End-to-end ID standard, `/l1-*` entry points, `docs/` layout |
| `10-conventions.mdc` | Core | Universal engineering discipline (`ponytail`, `codebase-design`, KISS/YAGNI), secrets, Make contract, TDD, Git |
| `20-workflow.mdc` | Core | Step-by-step instructions for all flows, status transitions, and `Roadmap Gate` |
| `30-tech-stack.mdc` | **Stack** | Project-specific tech stack, directory layout, and `Makefile` commands |
| `40-skills-router.mdc` | **Stack** | Skill routing table |
